WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.260
What do SCP-039, the Proboscis Engineers,&nbsp;
want more than anything in the world?

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:10.660
Foundation researchers used SCP-978,&nbsp;
the Desire Camera, to snap a picture of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:10.660 --> 00:00:15.880
four instances of SCP-039 while they were&nbsp;
grooming each other. This was the result:

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:21.760
"All 23 instances of SCP-039 performing&nbsp;
various repairs and modifications on a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.760 --> 00:00:26.980
lime green 1960 Chevrolet Nomad, which&nbsp;
is resting on a large, rectangular slab&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.980 --> 00:00:33.280
of concrete in what appears to be a mangrove&nbsp;
forest. SCP-039-A is in the driver's seat."

00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:37.960
These creatures just want to be in their&nbsp;
natural habitat, peaceful and happy.

